It is a horror, thriller, drama film directed by Andy Muschietti.

3
00:13:03,870 --> 00:13:09,870
In a small town in Maine, seven children known as The Losers Club come face to face with life
problems, bullies and a monster that takes the shape of a clown called Pennywise.

4
